{"pageid":1722,"title":"Fusion Coil","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Fusion Coil</span>","revid":22164,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Fusion Coil</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/24/Fusion_Coil.png/revision/latest?cb=20230829134136\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/24/Fusion_Coil.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230829134136\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/24/Fusion_Coil.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230829134136 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/24/Fusion_Coil.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/535?cb=20230829134136 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Fusion Coil\" width=\"270\" height=\"256\" data-image-key=\"Fusion_Coil.png\" data-image-name=\"Fusion Coil.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Classic store, Mike's MInes</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">~$26,233 (in materials and bombs)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Movement,Healing and Jump</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.39.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 28th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Fusion Coil</b> is a quest coil that combines the effects of the <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Coil\" title=\"Speed Coil\">Speed Coil</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Fusion Coil uses the same model as the classic Fusion Coil model from <i>Roblox</i>. It also emits a purple glow, similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Magnetite\" title=\"Magnetite\">Magnetite</a> ore. It is slightly variegated and not uniform in its shades of purple.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 273px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7d/Infusing.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004174451\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Fusion of the items\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7d/Infusing.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/273?cb=20231004174451\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"273\" height=\"188\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Infusing.png\" data-image-key=\"Infusing.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Infusing.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Fusion of the items</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Navigate to <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a> and acquire the <a href=\"/wiki/Infused_Core\" title=\"Infused Core\">Infused Core</a> by getting a <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushroom</a> to fire a spore at a regular <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Core\" title=\"Meteor Core\">Meteor Core</a>.</li>\n<li>Use bombs to detonate the wall blocking the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Oobmab\" title=\"Oobmab\">Oobmab</a> Lake near the mushroom cave and navigate inside.</li>\n<li>Place the Infused Core along with the Speed, Gravity, and Healing Coil into the magenta-colored lake.</li>\n<li>If done correctly, all of the items will begin to emit a sparkling effect and slowly fade away, thus beginning the fusion process. About 40 to 45 seconds after, all of the items will fuse into the Fusion Coil, and it will be able to be claimed. If any of the items belong to different players, they will sparkle but not fuse. All items must be under the same name in order for the coil to fuse.</li></ul>\n<p>Note that if the server load is high, the fusion process may take more time than usual.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Unlike the other coils, the Fusion Coil emits light, which may be useful for traversing dark areas.</li>\n<li>Having the coil equipped while driving any vehicle applies an anti-gravity effect on the vehicle as well. However, no speed or healing effect is applied. This also works with the <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_information\">New information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fusion coil now can be fused anywhere in a purple lake, going to Oobmab location is not required.</li>\n<li>You may see the ruins in mysterious cave, they are partially revealing the combination of Fusion coil.</li>\n<li>When you put first materials, they will start sparkling with white, and go to magenta when you put the rest.</li>\n<li>Fusion is followed by a dark violet explosion, same as meteor core getting infused.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831192715\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 77/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 65/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nL